---
// Nota al entrar — mismo estilo papel que QuestionModal
---

<dialog
  id="note-modal"
  class="bg-transparent m-auto p-0 outline-none"
  style="width: 90vw; max-width: 640px; max-height: 90vh; overflow: hidden;"
>
  <div
    class="relative flex flex-col rounded-sm"
    style="
    background-color: #e8dcc8;
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
      0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  "
  >
    <button
      id="note-modal-close"
      aria-label="Cerrar"
      class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-50 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-200 opacity-40 hover:opacity-80"
      style="color: #1a1510;"
    >
      <svg
        width="16"
        height="16"
        viewBox="0 0 14 14"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.8"
        stroke-linecap="round"
      >
        <line x1="1" y1="1" x2="13" y2="13"></line>
        <line x1="13" y1="1" x2="1" y2="13"></line>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center px-6 pt-6 mb-2"
    >
      <div class="w-6 h-6 text-[#8b3a3a] opacity-80">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
          ><path
            d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"
          ></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <div class="w-16 h-[2px] bg-[#1a1510]/15"></div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 flex flex-col px-5 md:px-8 pb-8 md:pb-10 flex-1 mt-4 md:mt-6"
    >
      <p
        class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase opacity-40 text-[#1a1510] mb-4"
        style="font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;"
      >
        Una nota para ti
      </p>

      <div
        class="text-[#1a1510] opacity-90 leading-relaxed text-center space-y-4"
        style="font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-size: 1.45rem;"
      >
        <p>
          Muchas gracias por tu amor. Ya sé que no me amas y está bien; eso no
          quita mis sentimientos.
        </p>
        <p>
          Eras eso por lo que valía la pena el mundo, por lo que sentir se
          sentía lindo. Eras lo que le daba razón a mi mundo.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.65rem;">Eras mi mundo.</p>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-right italic opacity-70 text-[#1a1510] mt-8"
        style="font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-size: 1.4rem;"
      >
        — ponss
      </p>

      <div class="flex justify-center mt-8">
        <button
          id="note-modal-ok"
          class="px-8 py-2.5 font-medium tracking-widest uppercase transition-all duration-300 rounded-sm"
          style="border: 1px solid rgba(139,58,58,0.5); color: #8b3a3a; background: rgba(139,58,58,0.05); font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;"
          >Guardar en el corazón</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<style>
  dialog#note-modal::backdrop {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }
</style>

<script>
  const noteModal = document.getElementById("note-modal") as HTMLDialogElement;
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById("note-modal-close");
  const okBtn = document.getElementById("note-modal-ok");

  const close = () => noteModal?.close();
  closeBtn?.addEventListener("click", close);
  okBtn?.addEventListener("click", close);

  if (noteModal) {
    setTimeout(() => {
      noteModal.showModal();
    }, 600);
  }
</script>
